Error [E0926]: this duration's unit isn't a recognized schedule cadence
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_duration_unit.jet:3:15
    |
  3 | #[Job, Every(5px)] fn prune_sessions() {
    |               ^^
 Why: a schedule's repeat interval uses the shared duration plane — `ns`/`us`/`µs`/`ms`/`s`/`sec`/`secs`/`min`/`h`/`d` — not an arbitrary `#UnitFamily` member.
 Fix: use a shared duration unit such as `min`, `h`, or `d` (e.g. `#Every(2h)`).
